{
  "version": "in-msme-default-2026.10",
  "description": "Default transaction classification rules for Indian MSME current-account statements. Replace or extend via TXN_RULES_FILE. Patterns are case-insensitive regular expressions applied to the narration normalised to upper case with separators (/ - : | _ *) turned into spaces.",
